Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:21:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(workflow): four-tier createRun when AG version columns
 are missing

Production createRun always sent definition_version, so inserts failed
while those columns are absent even though correlation columns exist.
Retry core+version+correlation, then version, then correlation, then
core; stop on non-schema errors. Report missing version columns as
degraded, refresh schema contracts on boot and first public health GET,
and keep a single /api/health handler.
